"Business Stack mide las visitas que llegan a esa web.": "Business Stack measures the visits that reach that website.",
"Business Stack no mide la web a la que lleva, o no hay ninguna web conectada.": "Business Stack doesn't measure the site it leads to, or no site is connected.",
"Business Stack sólo recibe la reserva ya hecha: no sabe quién abre la agenda y se va sin reservar.": "Business Stack only receives the finished booking: it doesn't know who opens the calendar and leaves without booking.",
"Business Stack todavía no tiene ninguna venta registrada.": "Business Stack has no sales recorded yet.",
"Business Stack todavía no tiene ninguna venta registrada: las ventas salen «sin medir», no cero.": "Business Stack has no sales recorded yet: sales show as “not measured”, not zero.",
"Business Stack todavía no tiene ninguna venta registrada: no se puede decir si hubo ventas.": "Business Stack has no sales recorded yet: we can't say whether there were any sales.",
