"La pone el panel solo a quien pulsa un enlace de pago: si la borras, volverá a aparecer con el siguiente clic.": "The panel adds it only to people who click a payment link: if you delete it, it will reappear with the next click.",
"La pone tu web a quien se registra, y el panel la usa para contar los registros.": "Your website adds it to anyone who signs up, and the panel uses it to count sign-ups.",
