"Se borrará «{0}» y todas sus ejecuciones y envíos.": "This will delete “{0}” and all its runs and sends.",
"Se buscarán por email los contactos sin web asignada, sin aplicar los filtros de esta lista. Se guardará aquí la primera web donde aparezcan; en tus webs no se cambia ni se envía nada.": "Contacts with no assigned website will be looked up by email, without applying the filters in this list. The first website where they are found will be saved here; nothing is changed or sent on your websites.",
"Se buscarán por email los contactos sin web asignada, sin aplicar los filtros de esta lista. Se guardará aquí la primera web donde aparezcan; en tus webs no se cambia ni se envía nada.{0}": "Contacts with no assigned website will be looked up by email, without applying the filters in this list. The first website where they are found will be saved here; nothing is changed or sent on your websites.{0}",
