"WhatsApp abre una ventana de 24 h cada vez que el cliente te escribe: dentro puedes chatear libremente; fuera, Meta solo acepta plantillas aprobadas. En cuanto esta persona responda, chatearás sin plantilla.": "WhatsApp opens a 24-hour window every time the customer writes to you: inside it you can chat freely; outside it, Meta only accepts approved templates. As soon as this person replies, you'll be able to chat without a template.",
