"«{0}» no se puede borrar: la usan {1}. Quítala de ahí primero; si no, dejarían de funcionar como esperas.": "“{0}” can't be deleted: it's used by {1}. Remove it from there first; otherwise they would stop working the way you expect.",
"«{0}» no tiene una dirección web válida (tiene que empezar por https://)": "“{0}” doesn't have a valid web address (it has to start with https://)",
"«{0}» pasa de 2,5 MB": "“{0}” is over 2.5 MB",
